Format: https://www.debian.org/doc/packaging-manuals/copyright-format/1.0/
Upstream-Name: koserver
Upstream-Contact: NachE <nache.nache@gmail.com>
Source: https://github.com/SecureCMD/cobiserver
Comment:
 usr/bin/koserver is a statically linked Go binary (CGO_ENABLED=0). Besides
 this project's own code (below), it links the Go modules listed further
 down, none of which are vendored into this source package: they are
 fetched over the network at build time via `go mod download`/`go build`,
 pinned by go.sum, and their license terms apply to the portions of the
 binary they contribute. Import paths are given as Files: for
 identification, matching `go.sum` and the module list `go version -m
 usr/bin/koserver` reports; they do not refer to paths actually present in
 this source package.

